# Pairs with CursorNeverSkipsUnshipped. The shipper advances its cursor to
# any acknowledged entry rather than only to the very next one, so an ack for
# a later pipelined batch skips an earlier one that was never delivered.
MODULE: CursorNeverSkipsUnshippedAckJumpsGap
TARGET: CursorNeverSkipsUnshipped
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: an out-of-order ack moves the cursor past an earlier entry that was never delivered
PERTURBS: Deliver

--- FIND
        acked == IF i = cursor[e] + 1 THEN [cursor EXCEPT ![e] = i] ELSE cursor
--- REPLACE
\* MUTATION: any ack above the cursor moves it.
        acked == IF i > cursor[e] THEN [cursor EXCEPT ![e] = i] ELSE cursor
--- END
